  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Tick, tock. How far can you make it in Twelve Seconds? Experience the thrill of jumping up as quickly as you can to reach the top of the screen. Some jumps are too tall or gaps are too large. You'll have to expertly place former versions of yourself higher and higher, piece by piece, to reach the goal. Twelve Seconds is packed with 150 levels that will challenge your patiences. Any of the 150 levels can be selected and played at any time. Having a hard time completing a level? Skip it and come back later! Fun for challenges, try different routes to get the best time or finish in the least amount of lives. The best times are automatically saved so you'll keep braggin rights for life. Or until you sister steals the controller and shows you how it's done."
    }
  ],
